import_eedomus.description:
Export the configuration using [eedomus Import / Export]({eedomus_export_url}), then use Browse to select the JSON file on your device. No /config upload is needed. The source JSON is temporary and is deleted after parsing. Day Planner objects are saved only after confirmation; no processed JSON file is produced.

Enabled and loaded eedomus boxes: {box_count}. If there is only one, it is automatically selected: {selected_box}. If several are active, choose the one corresponding to this JSON.

{details}

